OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,FA woman who diverted around #200,000
OL,7,Ffrom a charity's accounts while acting
OL,8,Fas its treasurer has been jailed for
OL,9,Fmore than three years.
OL,11,FGeraldine Coates, 60, was described as
OL,12,F'an outwardly respectable woman,
OL,13,Fentrusted by a local charity to look
OL,14,Fafter their finances'.
OL,16,FBut Exeter Crown Court heard that
OL,17,Fwhile acting as the treasurer of the
OL,18,FHoniton and District Agricultural
OL,19,FAssociation (HDAA) between 1996 and
OL,20,F2018 she 'succumbed to temptation'.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
