PN,40102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,FOn one occasion Coates, from Honiton,
OL,7,FDevon, transferred #11,083.55 from the
OL,8,Fcharity to pay off her own credit
OL,9,Fcard, falsely claiming it was to pay a
OL,10,FDevon & Cornwall Police invoice for
OL,11,Fshow policing.
OL,13,FShe wrote numerous cheques making them
OL,14,Fpayable to herself, before putting
OL,15,Fthem through the accounts ledger
OL,16,Fagainst either current or previous
OL,17,Fsuppliers.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,FCoates spent some of the proceeds of
OL,7,Fher fraud on home improvements, a
OL,8,Fholiday and covering the costs of
OL,9,Frunning her business.
OL,11,FShe was jailed for three years and
OL,12,Fnine months on Monday (10 August)
OL,13,Fhaving previously been found guilty of
OL,14,Ffraud.
OL,16,FHDAA is a registered charity that
OL,17,Fmakes donations on an annual basis to
OL,18,Fa wide range of local agricultural and
OL,19,Feducational causes.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,FAs treasurer, Coates was responsible
OL,7,Ffor being a signatory on cheque
OL,8,Fpayments, paying of bills and the day
OL,9,Fto day running of the charity's
OL,10,Faccounts.
OL,12,FBut, the court heard that Coates
OL,13,Ffalsified transactions and signatures
OL,14,Fon HDAA cheques to ensure large sums
OL,15,Fof money made their way to her.
OL,17,FShe then used the money for her own
OL,18,Fpersonal expenditure or benefit.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,FThe fraud was discovered when
OL,7,Ffinancial checks were carried out in
OL,8,F2018 following a dispute between
OL,9,FCoates and HDAA over a missing payment
OL,10,Fto a supplier.
OL,12,FThese events triggered further
OL,13,Ffinancial checks at HDAA, resulting in
OL,14,Fsuspicious transactions being
OL,15,Funcovered and Coates handing in her
OL,16,Fresignation in November 2018.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,FThey discovered cheques with
OL,7,Funidentified second signatures,
OL,8,Fmissing invoices and bank statements
OL,9,Ffabricated by Coates in an attempt to
OL,10,Fcover up her dishonest actions.
OL,12,FHDAA then notified the Charities
OL,13,FCommission and reported the matter to
OL,14,Fpolice resulting in the start of the
OL,15,Finvestigation.
OL,17,FAn expert witness report determined
OL,18,Fthat around transactions amounting to
OL,19,Fbetween #200,000 and #205,000 appeared
OL,20,Fto be fraudulent.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the HDAA said:
OL,7,FStatement: "The Board of Trustees,
OL,8,FOfficials and Members are extremely
OL,9,Fdisappointed and shocked that someone
OL,10,Fwho was employed and trusted by our
OL,11,FAssociation would abuse their position
OL,12,Fof trust in this way.
OL,14,F"It is deeply distressing as the money
OL,15,Ffraudulently embezzled by Geraldine
OL,16,Fembez had been raised by the
OL,17,Fassociation which includes many
OL,18,Fvolunteers and we find it
OL,19,Finconceivable that such a calculated
OL,20,Findividual managed to hide herself in
OL,21,Four charity.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,F"We are very upset that someone who we
OL,7,Fall knew and trusted could possibly be
OL,8,Fso devious as to steal in excess of
OL,9,F#200,000 from a local, well regarded
OL,10,Fand respected charity.
OL,12,F"Not only has the Honiton and District
OL,13,FAgricultural Association been
OL,14,Fdefrauded but this has impacted the
OL,15,Fdonations we have been able to make to
OL,16,Fnumerous other charities and rural
OL,17,Fcommunity that the association has
OL,18,Fsupported over many years."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,FDetective Constable Alan Findlay from
OL,7,Fthe Fraud Triage and Support Team at
OL,8,FDevon and Cornwall Police said:
OL,9,F"Geraldine Coates over the course of
OL,10,Faround nine years between 2009 and
OL,11,F2018 betrayed a position of trust she
OL,12,Fheld at a highly thought-of local
OL,13,Fcharity.
OL,15,F"Coates defrauded the charity out of
OL,16,Fvital funds that could have been used
OL,17,Fto benefit others, spending the money
OL,18,Fon her own needs and wants.
OL,26,@qD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786376897
OL,3,CCharity treasurer jailed for diverting
OL,4,Cmore than #200k to her own accounts
OL,6,F"Coates took active steps to try and
OL,7,Fcover her offending and at no point
OL,8,Fdid she have the courage to admit what
OL,9,Fshe did ` even taking the matter to
OL,10,Ftrial despite the strong financial
OL,11,Fevidence against her.
OL,13,F"I'd like to thank the jury for their
OL,14,Fattention to detail when considering
OL,15,Fthe case, and welcome the sentence
OL,16,Fgiven to Coates.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/11
